                <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:150%'><span
                style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif;
                color:#0B344F'>IREN today reported its Q2 FY25 results.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:150%'><span
                style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif;
                color:#0B344F'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:150%'><span
                style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif;
                color:#0B344F'>Please find a link to the announcement <a
                href="https://iren.us14.list-manage.com/track/click?u=d65d3565f9cb81130e9bfb0ca&amp;id=b09021fcc4&amp;e=f5f7aeeaa6"
