                <td style='padding:.75pt .25in 9.0pt 37.5pt;border-radius:0'>
                <div data-block-id=9 id=dataBlockId-9>
                <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc>
                 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#0B344F;line-height:150%;
                     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span
                     style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif'>Revenues
                     of $119.6m<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#0B344F;line-height:150%;
                     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span
                     style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif'>Operating
                     cashflow of $53.7m<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#0B344F;line-height:150%;
                     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span
                     style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif'>NPAT
                     of $18.9m<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#0B344F;line-height:150%;
                     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span
                     style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif'>75MW
                     liquid-cooled Childress data center for AI / HPC (“Horizon
                     1”)<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#0B344F;line-height:150%;
                     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span
                     style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif'>Developing
                     new 600MW site to create 2GW Sweetwater data center hub<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#0B344F;line-height:150%;
                     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span
                     style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif'>Expansion
                     from 31 EH/s to 50 EH/s in H1 2025<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#0B344F;line-height:150%;
                     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span
                     style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif'>U.S.
                     domestic issuer status confirmed to be adopted in H2 2025<o:p></o:p></span></li>
                </ul>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;line-height:150%'><span
                style='font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Tahoma",sans-serif;
                color:#0B344F'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:150%'><span
