              <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify"><span><img width="660" src="https://mcusercontent.com/d65d3565f9cb81130e9bfb0ca/images/4392525f-1ce8-b015-85b7-b012aa03e2bb.jpg" style="width:660px" data-block-id="4" class="imageDropZone mceImage" /></span><span></span></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></div></span><p></p>
              </td>
             </tr>
             <tr>
              <td>
              <table class="MsoNormalTable">
               <tr>
                <td>
                <div data-block-id="5">
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#0B344F">IREN
                Reports Q2 FY25 Results</span><span style="color:#0B344F"></span></p>
                </div>
                </td>
               </tr>
              </table>
              </td>
             </tr>
             <tr>
              <td>
              <table class="MsoNormalTable">
               <tr>
                <td>
                <div data-block-id="6">
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#0B344F">Dear All,</span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#0B344F"> </span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#0B344F">IREN today reported its Q2 FY25 results.</span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#0B344F"> </span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#0B344F">Please find a link to the announcement <a href="https://iren.us14.list-manage.com/track/click?u=d65d3565f9cb81130e9bfb0ca&amp;id=b09021fcc4&amp;e=f5f7aeeaa6"><strong><span style="color:#0B344F">here</span></strong></a>.</span></p>
                </div>
                </td>
               </tr>
              </table>
              </td>
             </tr>
             <tr>
              <td>
              <table class="MsoNormalTable">
               <tr>
                <td>
                <div data-block-id="7">
                <p class="MsoNormal"><i><span style="color:#0B344F">Key Highlights</span></i><i><span style="color:#0B344F"></span></i></p>
                </div>
                </td>
               </tr>
              </table>
              </td>
             </tr>
             <tr>
              <td>
              <div align="center">
              <table class="MsoNormalTable" data-block-id="8">
               <tr>
                <td>
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span> </span></p>
                </td>
               </tr>
              </table>
              </div>
              </td>
             </tr>
             <tr>
              <td>
              <table class="MsoNormalTable">
               <tr>
                <td>
                <div data-block-id="9">
                <ul>
                 <li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#0B344F"><span>Revenues
                     of $119.6m</span></li>
                 <li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#0B344F"><span>Operating
                     cashflow of $53.7m</span></li>
                 <li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#0B344F"><span>NPAT
                     of $18.9m</span></li>
                 <li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#0B344F"><span>75MW
                     liquid-cooled Childress data center for AI / HPC (“Horizon
                     1”)</span></li>
                 <li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#0B344F"><span>Developing
                     new 600MW site to create 2GW Sweetwater data center hub</span></li>
                 <li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#0B344F"><span>Expansion
                     from 31 EH/s to 50 EH/s in H1 2025</span></li>
                 <li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#0B344F"><span>U.S.
                     domestic issuer status confirmed to be adopted in H2 2025</span></li>
                </ul>
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#0B344F"> </span></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#0B344F">The presentation and webcast replay can be
                accessed <a href="https://iren.us14.list-manage.com/track/click?u=d65d3565f9cb81130e9bfb0ca&amp;id=9550de9a2b&amp;e=f5f7aeeaa6"><strong><span style="color:#0B344F">here</span></strong></a>.</span></p>
                </div>
                </td>
               </tr>
              </table>
              </td>
             </tr>
             <tr>
              <td>
              <table class="MsoNormalTable">
               <tr>
                <td>
                <div data-block-id="10">
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#0B344F">If you have any questions, please do not
                hesitate to let us know.</span></p>
                </div>
                </td>
               </tr>
              </table>
              </td>
             </tr>
             <tr>
              <td>
              <table class="MsoNormalTable">
               <tr>
                <td>
                <div data-block-id="11">
                <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#0B344F">Regards,</span></p>
                </div>
                </td>
               </tr>
              </table>
              </td>
             </tr>
